# MSMCP worked-example query: a single MS2 spectrum whose peaks are caffeine's.
# See "Try it in 60 seconds" in README.md.  Searching this against
# examples/caffeine_library.msp is a known true positive, so caffeine should
# rank first.
BEGIN IONS
TITLE=Caffeine_demo_MS2
PEPMASS=195.0877
MSLEVEL=2
RTINSECONDS=132.0
110.0713 40.0
120.0808 100.0
136.0757 60.0
138.0662 420.0
500.1 55.0
END IONS
